 'section:enterprise-network-segmentation:0':['Logical boundaries alone are not enforced microsegmentation or zero trust. No full policy-decision/enforcement architecture or identity-per-session control is taught or executed.','North-south/east-west are environment-relative directions, not universal physical compass directions. VLAN/subnet alignment and routed enforcement depend on the architecture.'],
